  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "3BR Santa Rosa Beach Home Near 30A. Community Pool. 5 Beach Accesses.<br><br>Welcome to Ella's Summer, a beautifully located three-bedroom vacation rental in Santa Rosa Beach, Florida, just minutes from Scenic Highway 30A. This coastal home is perfect for families, couples, and friends looking for a relaxing beach getaway near the Gulf.<br><br>The home features 3 comfortable bedrooms, offering plenty of space for guests to relax after a day at the beach. 7 maximum people allowed. There is an additional cot in the primary suite. The open living area provides a welcoming place to gather, unwind, and enjoy the laid-back coastal lifestyle that makes Santa Rosa Beach vacation rentals so popular. Parking for 2 vehicles only. No neighborhood parking unless you are using the pool.<br><br>Guests have access to the neighborhood community pool and barbecue area, ideal for swimming, grilling, and enjoying sunny Florida afternoons. Whether you’re planning a casual pool day or an evening cookout, this shared space adds to the resort-style experience. Pool is located about 8 houses down.<br><br>One of the biggest highlights of this 30A vacation home is the unbeatable beach access. With 5 nearby public beach accesses, you’re just a short walk, bike or golf cart ride from the white-sand beaches and emerald waters Santa Rosa Beach is known for. Having multiple access points allows you to explore different stretches of coastline with ease.<br><br>Located close to restaurants, shopping, biking trails, and local attractions, this home offers the perfect balance of comfort, convenience, and coastal charm.<br><br>Book your stay at Ella's Summer and enjoy one of the best beach house rentals near 30A—where poolside relaxation and easy beach access come together.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Your perfect 30A Getaway: Beach Access, Sparkling Pool & Coastal Comfort"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
